  "prefLabel": "Puc 2506.02 Metering of Customer-Sited Sources",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2506.02 Metering of Customer-Sited Sources.\n\n(a) A customer-sited source shall use a revenue quality meter or other meter tested and certified by the manufacturer to meet ANSI C-12 standards to measure the electricity generated.\n\n(b) A customer-sited source shall certify to the independent monitor that the meter operates to the manufacturer’s standards.\n\n(c) A customer-sited source shall maintain the meter according to the manufacturer’s recommendations.\n\nSource. #9169, eff 6-3-08; ss by #10741, eff 12-5-14 (from Puc 2505.10); ss by #12473, eff 2-1-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc2500.html"
